        <p>The deaths included-1 from diarhcea, 3 from phthisi-s: 2 from cancer, 2 from kidney disease, 3from brain dis- ease„ 2 from lung disease, 3 from debility. The following cases of infectious disease have been reported during the week i—Scarlet fever, 2 cases. . _ . . .</p>
