        <p>Sufferers from Grwel, Lumbago, Piles, Pains in the Back. Dropsy, Wind and Water Complaint. Diseas-s of Kidneys, Bladder Stone, Se'atica. Rheumatism and Gout will find a positive Cure in Boiroyd's Gravel Pills. Try a small box and if not satisfied your money will be returned. Prices Is. of all Chemists, or past free for 12 stamps, from HOLRMIWIS Medical Hall, Checkheaten, Yorks. Don't be put off. If you cannot get them write to the Proprietor and a box will be sent next post.—Advt.</p>
