        <p>PUNsIoN Mit (Sergeant Tast five years of Service), good dri 11 , fair penman,WANTS CAIIII of Invalid Gentleman, Care of Club, wait table, generally useful and trustworthy. unexceptional references. F.W.S.. 22, MASSZ-TERRAZE. Liverpool.</p>
